cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Barcode Simulator
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: David
    family-names: Molik
repository-code: 'https://github.com/molikd/Barcode_Simulator'
url: 'https://github.com/molikd/Barcode_Simulator'
abstract: >-
  Barcode Simulator creates controlled sets of related DNA barcode,
  amplicon, or gene-copy sequences and samples them into FASTA/FASTQ
  files. It includes a factorial experimental-design layer for the five
  metabarcode effects studied in Molik, Pfrender, and Emrich (2020) and
  a dependency-free POSIX AWK distance analysis with SVG graphs.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - metabarcoding
  - dna-barcodes
  - simulation
  - factorial-design
  - awk
license: Apache-2.0
